"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(293.2,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D43F\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43F\"></use></g><rect width=\"827.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(5727,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Unit : A/m or Am<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"2.232ex\" height=\"1.887ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 986.7 833.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2212\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2212\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>(C) Magnetic flux, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.464ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.78ex\" height=\"2.084ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 3438.6 921\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D719\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D719\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(873.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(1929.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D435\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D435\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2688.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>unit : weber</p>\n<p>(D) Magnetic moment (M) : magnetic moment of a current loop, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"10.241ex\" height=\"1.62ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 4526.6 716\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D440\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D440\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1328.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(2384.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D441\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D441\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3272.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D43C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D43C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(3776.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"1D434\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D434\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>where, N = number of turns</p>\n<p>I = current</p>\n<p>A = Area</p>\n<p>So, unit = Am<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: 0;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"0.988ex\" height=\"1.887ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -833.9 436.6 833.9\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msup\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(33,363) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"32\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-32\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>Hence, option A is correct.</p>","exam":"jee-main"}]}